## Skills

Each line says which skill to load for a request. The skill holds the steps; do not copy them here.

- When committing: `<skill-tree>/<commit-skill>/SKILL.md`
- When opening a pull request: `<skill-tree>/<pull-request-skill>/SKILL.md`
- When adding or changing an instruction, a skill or a reference document: `<skill-tree>/<placing-instructions>/SKILL.md`
- When filing a one-off bug or task: `<skill-tree>/<issue-skill>/SKILL.md`. A planned feature goes to `<skill-tree>/<plan-skill>/SKILL.md` instead.
